244
00:20:06,910 --> 00:20:08,370
I stole it.

245
00:20:13,250 --> 00:20:14,640
You broke into cars?!

246
00:20:21,250 --> 00:20:24,920
We had time on our hands,
so Eddy and I often did it.

247
00:20:24,920 --> 00:20:27,950
