251
00:20:41,210 --> 00:20:43,880
No, look! This is Sonny Boy Waters' guitar.

252
00:20:43,880 --> 00:20:47,050
He's a blues guitarist.
Even Eric Clapton respects him.

253
00:20:47,050 --> 00:20:48,880
He's a legend.

254
00:20:48,880 --> 00:20:50,220
Sonny Boy?

255
00:20:50,220 --> 00:20:53,890
Serial Number...8-3001...

256
00:20:53,890 --> 00:20:55,150
Dude, that's it!

257
00:20:55,150 --> 00:20:56,890
Come on! Let's go!

258
00:20:56,890 --> 00:20:58,560
See, Sonny Boy and this guy were

259
00:20:58,560 --> 00:21:01,390
