right on the stage.

261
00:21:04,400 --> 00:21:05,900
You mean, during the play?

262
00:21:05,900 --> 00:21:09,970
The guitar's been called Lucille
ever since then.

263
00:21:09,970 --> 00:21:11,560
That's insane...

264
00:21:13,570 --> 00:21:16,340
Okay. Let's get outta here. Come on.

